@startuml layers
title Tidyfy — Camadas (Clean Architecture)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
set namespaceSeparator none

package "com.tidyfy (composição)" as bootstrap {
  class Main
  class AppContainer
}

package "com.tidyfy.presentation" as presentation {
}

package "com.tidyfy.infrastructure" as infrastructure {
}

package "com.tidyfy.application" as application {
}

package "com.tidyfy.domain" as domain {
}

bootstrap ..> presentation : inicia a interface
bootstrap ..> infrastructure : instancia
bootstrap ..> application : monta casos de uso
presentation ..> application : chama casos de uso
infrastructure ..> application : implementa portas
application ..> domain : usa entidades

note as NDomain
  <b>domain</b>
  Regras de negócio puras.
  Só Java, sem JavaFX e sem Windows.
end note
NDomain .. domain

note as NApplication
  <b>application</b>
  Casos de uso + portas (interfaces)
  para o mundo externo.
end note
NApplication .. application

note as NInfrastructure
  <b>infrastructure</b>
  schtasks.exe, lixeira, disco,
  persistência das configurações.
end note
NInfrastructure .. infrastructure

note as NPresentation
  <b>presentation</b>
  Telas JavaFX.
  Sem regra de negócio.
end note
NPresentation .. presentation

legend bottom
  As setas indicam dependência de código e sempre apontam para dentro (rumo ao domínio).
  Somente a composição (Main / AppContainer) conhece todas as camadas.
endlegend

@enduml
